  --customer-acceptance-date: string # The date when the customer accepts the amendment's changes to the subscription. This field is only required if [Zuora is configured to require customer acceptance in Z-Billing](https://knowledgecenter.zuora.com/CB_Billing/W_Billing_and_Payments_Settings/Define_Default_Subscription_Settings) and the subscription is currently in the Pending Acceptance status (the value of the `Status` field is currently `PendingAcceptance`). Use this field together with the `Status` field. When you set a date in this field as a customer acceptance date, you should also set the `Status` field as `Completed`. (format: date)
