  --bill-cycle-type: string # Specifies how to determine the billing day for the charge. **Character limit**: 20 **Values**: one of the following: - `DefaultFromCustomer` - `SpecificDayofMonth:` - `SubscriptionStartDay` - `ChargeTriggerDay` - `SpecificDayofWeek` **Note**: - If you set this field to `SpecificDayofMonth`, you must specify which day of the month as the billing day for the charge in the BillCycleDay field. - If you set this field to `SpecificDayofWeek`, you must specify which day of the week as the billing day for the charge in the WeeklyBillCycleDay field.
