  --billing-timing: string # The billing timing for the charge. You can choose to bill in advance or in arrears for recurring charge types. This field is not used in one-time or usage based charge types. **Character limit**: **Values**: one of the following: - `In Advance` - `In Arrears` This feature is in **Limited Availability**. If you wish to have access to the feature, submit a request at [Zuora Global Support](http://support.zuora.com/).
