  --status: string # The status of the subscription. **Character limit**: 17 **Values**: automatically generated **Possible values**: one of the following: - `Draft` - `Pending Activation` - `Pending Acceptance` - `Active` - `Cancelled` - `Expired` - `Suspended` (This value is in **Limited Availability**.)
