  --collect: oneof<nothing, bool> # Collects an automatic payment for a subscription. The collection generated in this operation is only for this subscription, not for the entire customer account. If the value is `true`, the automatic payment is collected. If the value is `false`, no action is taken. Prerequisite: The `invoice` or `runBilling` field must be `true`. **Note**: This field is only available if you set the `zuora-version` request header to `196.0` or later. (default: false)
